  "<strong>Perception</strong> gathers what the agent can know, <strong>reasoning</strong> chooses what to do, and <strong>action</strong> changes the environment. Perception and action often come from an existing interaction model, whether it controls a vacuum, web automation, a game entity, or a humanoid. The reasoning step can change without changing that boundary, which separates capability from reach.": "<strong>感知</strong>負責收集代理程式能夠獲知的資訊，<strong>推理</strong>決定要做什麼，<strong>行動</strong>則改變環境。感知和行動通常源自現有的互動模型，無論它控制的是吸塵器、Web 自動化程式、遊戲實體還是人形機器人。推理步驟可以在不改變這一邊界的情況下發生變化，從而將能力與觸達範圍區分開來。",
  "<span class=\"learning-scope\">Deep · Concepts</span><span class=\"learning-question\">Explore the loop and classic architectures?</span>": "<span class=\"learning-scope\">深入 · 概念</span><span class=\"learning-question\">探索代理程式迴圈和經典架構？</span>",
